    "$t": "看電影"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><b style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>陳昭蓉</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">坐落電影院</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">我恬靜起碇--looh</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tèr著流勢</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">行過風雨</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">走過坎坷</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">有時風平湧靜</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">有時tu風衝湧</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">一个湧頭　一个鏡頭</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">一个鏡頭　一款人生</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">苦盡甘來</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">我飄撇pha碇</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">將所有ê風雨、坎坷</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">lak hōo電影院</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>（本文是澎湖同安腔）</b></span></p><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhklLmz6Thz3hLC7d2q9OnN6zM2TwRbu_rhQh13axyfa5vuYeJSISVroRij44Hg6jHMd6FkPl0BJulwW97MXSuuof68UBFoJH7ESwFV5Gq9rkW_RmcGK2oEoFv2gvWxMWrbXLkt9lrDn5u_hrOUuEyzeWPL-L1TDP0DyvN6HLpGk23nj6GDISHpuVwPUQ/s1424/336%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhklLmz6Thz3hLC7d2q9OnN6zM2TwRbu_rhQh13axyfa5vuYeJSISVroRij44Hg6jHMd6FkPl0BJulwW97MXSuuof68UBFoJH7ESwFV5Gq9rkW_RmcGK2oEoFv2gvWxMWrbXLkt9lrDn5u_hrOUu